WEBVTT

00:06:58.815 --> 00:07:00.784
And my brother and I were both accepted.

00:07:02.185 --> 00:07:03.353
And the best part was,

00:07:03.386 --> 00:07:06.022
my parents told us
that at this new school,

00:07:06.022 --> 00:07:07.824
we wouldn't have to hide anymore.

00:07:09.359 --> 00:07:12.028
So at Waynflete,
they start each school year off

00:07:12.062 --> 00:07:14.864
by sending the students on a bonding trip.

00:07:15.498 --> 00:07:19.436
They do this by dropping the freshmen
in the middle of the woods

00:07:19.469 --> 00:07:21.271
and tell us to "get along."

00:07:21.705 --> 00:07:22.839
It's charming.

00:07:22.872 --> 00:07:24.274
(Laughter)

00:07:24.307 --> 00:07:25.608
We stayed in yurts.

00:07:25.642 --> 00:07:27.510
(Laughter)

00:07:27.944 --> 00:07:29.713
But during this trip,

00:07:29.746 --> 00:07:31.881
I noticed something I was struggling with.